sn4.4:1.4 | S: “Mendicants!” | T: “Bhikkhus!”
sn4.4:1.5 | S: “Venerable sir,” they replied. | T: “Venerable sir!” those bhikkhus replied.
sn4.4:1.6 | S: The Buddha said this: | T: The Blessed One said this:
sn4.4:2.1 | S: “Mendicants, I have attained and realized supreme freedom through rational application of mind and rational right effort. | T: “Bhikkhus, by careful attention, by careful right striving, I have arrived at unsurpassed liberation, I have realized unsurpassed liberation.
